# Versus with the computer: the opponent / side / level rows of the mode screen, then the mode list below them.
# Layout (1400x800): main menu Versus (150,250). Opponent row y=122: Two players (671,122), Computer (833,122).
#   Side row y=174: White (644), Black (752), Random (860); Level row y=226: Easy (644), Normal (752), Hard (860).
#   With the computer the mode list starts lower: Standard (690,320). Back/Play at y=712 (Play 808).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 833 122        # Computer
wait 40
capture vs-setup-defaults       # White and Normal (the defaults), the level's one-line description
click 860 174        # Random
click 860 226        # Hard
wait 20
capture vs-setup-random-hard
click 752 174        # Black
click 644 226        # Easy
wait 20
capture vs-setup-black-easy
click 690 320        # Standard
wait 30
capture vs-setup-standard-selected   # Play appears
click 671 122        # back to Two players: the extra rows go and the list moves up, the selection stays
wait 40
capture vs-setup-two-players
